<title>AUSTRALIA: GUD buys N.Z. sheep shearing group.</title>
<headline>GUD buys N.Z. sheep shearing group.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>G.U.D. Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday that its Sunbeam unit had acquired Agrisales N.Z. Ltd, a New Zealand-based distributor of sheep shearing equipment.</p>
<p>The company did not disclose the purchase price but said Agrisales had annual sales of about NZ$6.5 million.</p>
<p>It said Agrisales was the leading distributor of sheep shearing products in New Zealand, which was the world's second largest market for mechanical sheep shearing equipment.</p>
<p>The Sunbeam unit was the world's leading supplier of sheep shearing equipment, G.U.D. said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
